{"lines": [{"text": "The average new car costs fifty thousand dollars. Five years later... twenty-one thousand of it is just gone.", "start": 0.1, "end": 6.34, "spec": {"mood": "tense"}, "words": [["The", 0.089, 0.145], ["average", 0.145, 0.469], ["new", 0.469, 0.737], ["car", 0.737, 1.06], ["costs", 1.06, 1.562], ["fifty", 1.574, 1.897], ["thousand", 1.897, 2.266], ["dollars", 2.266, 2.746], ["Five", 3.136, 3.404], ["years", 3.404, 3.694], ["later", 3.694, 4.074], ["twenty-one", 4.498, 4.81], ["thousand", 4.81, 5.156], ["of", 5.156, 5.212], ["it", 5.212, 5.29], ["is", 5.301, 5.413], ["just", 5.413, 5.603], ["gone", 5.614, 5.904]]}, {"text": "That's three hundred fifty dollars a month. For nothing!", "start": 6.54, "end": 9.372, "spec": {}, "words": [["That's", 0.086, 0.334], ["three", 0.409, 0.593], ["hundred", 0.593, 0.765], ["fifty", 0.765, 1.034], ["dollars", 1.034, 1.325], ["a", 1.336, 1.358], ["month", 1.358, 1.735], ["For", 2.112, 2.187], ["nothing", 2.198, 2.522]]}, {"text": "But here's the thing: not every car loses the same.", "start": 9.722, "end": 13.058, "spec": {"mood": "calm"}, "words": [["But", 0.108, 0.18], ["here's", 0.18, 0.421], ["the", 0.433, 0.517], ["thing", 0.517, 0.841], ["not", 1.346, 1.538], ["every", 1.55, 1.803], ["car", 1.803, 2.115], ["loses", 2.115, 2.476], ["the", 2.476, 2.548], ["same", 2.56, 2.969]]}, {"text": "The worst? The Nissan Leaf. Sixty-three percent... gone.", "start": 13.258, "end": 17.386, "spec": {"mood": "tense"}, "words": [["The", 0.094, 0.153], ["worst", 0.165, 0.625], ["The", 1.014, 1.05], ["Nissan", 1.061, 1.568], ["Leaf", 1.568, 1.946], ["Sixty-three", 2.335, 2.972], ["percent", 2.972, 3.455], ["gone", 3.467, 3.774]]}, {"text": "The best? A Porsche Cayman. It lost less than ten percent!", "start": 17.586, "end": 21.33, "spec": {"mood": "bright", "cut": true}, "words": [["The", 0.099, 0.143], ["best", 0.153, 0.548], ["A", 0.899, 0.943], ["Porsche", 0.954, 1.305], ["Cayman", 1.305, 1.645], ["It", 2.007, 2.083], ["lo